  "description": "Welcome to 196 Celebration Boulevard, Clarkson - a stylish and easy-care townhouse offering comfortable modern living in a convenient northern suburbs location.<br/><br/>Perfectly suited to professionals, couples or those seeking a low-maintenance lifestyle, this well-presented home combines practical living spaces with an excellent location close to shopping, transport, parks and the coast.<br/><br/>The home features two bedrooms, two bathrooms and parking for two cars with brand new hybrid floors for easy maintenance through main living areas, providing a comfortable and functional layout with plenty of privacy.<br/><br/>The open-plan living and dining area creates a welcoming space to relax and entertain, while the well-appointed kitchen provides everything you need for easy everyday living.<br/><br/>Both bedrooms are generously sized, with the two-bathroom layout offering added convenience for residents and guests.<br/><br/>Outside, enjoy a private, low-maintenance setting designed for easy living without the upkeep of a large garden.<br/><br/>Property Features<br/>-Brand new hybrid floors in many areas of the property<br/>-Two bedrooms<br/>-Two bathrooms<br/>-Two car spaces<br/>-Open-plan living and dining<br/>-Well-appointed kitchen<br/>-Low-maintenance outdoor area<br/>-Practical townhouse layout<br/>-Modern, easy-care living<br/>-Convenient location<br/><br/>Location Highlights<br/>-Close to Ocean Keys Shopping Centre<br/>-Easy access to local shops, cafés and restaurants<br/>-Convenient public transport options<br/>-Close to local parks and recreational facilities<br/>-Short drive to Mindarie Marina and nearby beaches<br/>-Easy access to major northern suburbs<br/>-Schools and educational facilities nearby<br/>-Convenient access to main roads and transport links<br/><br/>Located in a convenient pocket of Clarkson, 196 Celebration Boulevard offers an ideal combination of comfort, convenience and low-maintenance living.<br/><br/>Don't miss the opportunity to secure this fantastic home in a highly sought-after location. Register your interest today and experience everything this property has to offer.<br/><br/>----<br/><br/>WANT TO VIEW THIS PROPERTY? Simply click the BOOK INSPECTION button and you will immediately be able to see and book into any available viewing times. (if a date isn't currently available you will receive an SMS and Email as soon as it becomes available to view)<br/><br/>To ensure a smooth viewing and application process, please note the following:<br/><br/>1. Please ensure you register to view (note; all attending parties MUST be registered)<br/>2. If a viewing is not available then please be patient, we will notify you as soon as a time becomes available<br/>3. A flyer will be provided at the home open outlining step by step instructions on how to submit your application.<br/>4. Our application processing team will keep you updated on the progress and outcome of your application - please keep in mind that it can take 24-48 working hours to process when many applications are received. We suggest giving your references a heads up that we may be in touch - this will help expedite the process!<br/>5. Please note that only applications submitted via Tenant Options will be considered.",
